**/*.pdf
# ...except the compiled thesis draft, tracked deliberately so each citation-audit tag pins the
# exact PDF that the tagged sources produced. No other PDF is tracked -- paper library included.
!docs/thesis/thesis_draft.pdf
target/
tune_plots/
__pycache__/
**/*CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
**/*.zip
# colcon build logs (this repo is also a colcon workspace root)
log/

# ── Thesis writing track: LOCAL ONLY ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The thesis SUPPORTING DOCUMENTS and the paper library stay off the remote. They were
# purged from the pushed history on 2026-08-24 and must not be re-added.
#
# CHANGED 2026-08-27: the manuscript SOURCES are now tracked, so the citation baseline can be
# a real git tag rather than a hash list. Only .tex and CITATION_BASELINE.md are let back in;
# build artefacts, the compiled PDF and everything else under docs/thesis/ stay out. Note that
# **/*.pdf at the top of this file already excludes every PDF, including thesis_draft.pdf.
docs/thesis/*
!docs/thesis/*.tex
!docs/thesis/CITATION_BASELINE.md
!docs/thesis/CITATION_EDIT_LOG.md
!docs/thesis/thesis_draft.pdf
docs/papers/
# docs/references.bib -- the manuscript bibliography -- is tracked with the sources above.
docs/15_Problem_Statement_and_Research_Questions.md
docs/16_Related_Work_Structure.md
docs/17_Source_Ledger_and_Citation_Discipline.md
docs/18_Strategy_Descriptions.md
docs/19_Contribution_Statement.md
docs/20_Verified_Claims.md
docs/THESIS_REVIEW_BRIEF.md
# Archived 2026-08-27 to docs/_archive/citation_notes/. The ignore rules are path-specific,
# so the move would otherwise have un-ignored these and made them committable again.
docs/_archive/citation_notes/16_Related_Work_Structure.md
docs/_archive/citation_notes/17_Source_Ledger_and_Citation_Discipline.md
docs/_archive/citation_notes/20_Verified_Claims.md
docs/_archive/citation_notes/THESIS_REVIEW_BRIEF.md
